//
// Zero-Log Architecture:
// - No telemetry, analytics, tracking, or reporting of any kind.
// - All processing MUST occur locally on the user's device.
// - No storage of user content, comment text, or behavioral data.
// - No network transmission of user-identifying information.
//
// Security & Governance:
// - This file is hash-checked by CI. Unauthorized modifications fail build.
// - Permissions granted here MUST remain minimal and strictly necessary.
// - Any attempt to escalate permissions (tabs, scripting, webRequest,
//   identity, cookies, or network interception) voids this license.
//
// DOM Boundary Rule:
// - Only content scripts may access platform DOM.
// - Core and background scripts MUST NOT touch raw HTML or user data.
// - Adapters MUST remain confined to their platform namespaces.
//
// Any violation of these constraints terminates all granted rights under
